// preset: every shell command asks first. drop it into ~/.config/cmx2/cmx2.jsonc (every project) or a
// project's .cmx2/cmx2.jsonc (that project only). a phone or the terminal answers once, always (saves the
// command's prefix for the project, like `git status *`) or reject. file edits inside the project stay
// allowed; see docs/permissions.md for the rest of the default policy.
{
  "permissions": {
    "shell": "ask"
  }
}
